   "briefTitle": "Spiriva® Assessment of FEV1 (SAFE)",
   "officialTitle": "Spiriva® Assessment of FEV1 (SAFE). The Effect of Inhaled Tiotropium Bromide (18 Mcg Once Daily) on the Change in FEV1 During Long-term Treatment in Patients With COPD. A One-year Parallel Group, Double-blind, Randomised, Placebo-controlled Study"
  },
